{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL090aGVyc19MYW5ndWFnZS9DaGluZXNlLU1vdmllcy9UaGUlMjBNaWdodHklMjBQZWtpbmclMjBNYW4lMjAlMjgxOTc3JTI5Lw","type":"movie","name":"The Mighty Peking Man","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/yd7eSDBf0w7Oo6CRI1RC5SkR7mt.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/cV592GNIOkyI1J4fz6jFUuytF9e.jpg","description":"Word of a monster ape ten stories tall living in the Himalayas reaches fortune hunters in Hong Kong. They travel to India to capture it, but wild animals and quicksand dissuade all but Johnny, an adventurer with a broken heart. He finds the monster and discovers it's been raising a scantily-clad woman, Samantha, since she survived a plane crash years before that killed her parents. In the idyllic jungle, Johnny and Samantha fall in love. Then Johnny asks her to convince \"Utam\" to go to Hong Kong. Lu Tien, an unscrupulous promoter, takes over: Utam is in chains for freak show exhibitions. When Lu Tien assaults Samantha, Utam's protective instincts take over: havoc in Hong Kong.","releaseInfo":"1977","genres":["Action","Fantasy","Adventure","Horror","Others"],"imdbRating":"5.1","runtime":"90 min","cast":["Evelyne Kraft","Danny Lee Sau-yin","Ku Feng","Lam Wai-Tiu","Norman Tsui Siu-keung","Ng Hong-Sang","Ted Thomas","Steve Nicholson"],"director":["Ho Meng-Hua"],"released":"1977-08-11T00:00:00.000Z","slogan":"Action... Excitement... Spectacle beyond your wildest dreams!","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Evelyne Kraft","character":"Ah Wei","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9FCRJmQbdi3XepQOKYYraj1wVrf.jpg"},{"name":"Danny Lee Sau-yin","character":"Johnny Chen Zheng Feng","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fyRGlzi1fF20d37ryTQx8aK6k49.jpg"},{"name":"Ku Feng","character":"Lu Tien","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xHapsB0Px5nbwpjh5cnVkDuzUwA.jpg"},{"name":"Lam Wai-Tiu","character":"Chen Shi Yu","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bBEVZMTdy8lrU6JwZ2q4HCA1iei.jpg"},{"name":"Norma